# The Hero's last job node, and the biggest single cast in the game: twelve
# slashes of four lines, then five explosions of five, all of it on eight
# enemies. Modelled as the twelve and the five GMS states rather than as one
# 48-line swing and one 25-line hit -- the total is the same either way, but a
# folded swing would say the skill is something it is not, and the ledger would
# draw one landing where GMS draws twelve.
#
# The final damage it detonates is worth six Combo Orbs for eight seconds, and
# it goes up AT THE CAST. GMS draws the distinction in one sentence: the
# explosions come "afterwards" and the final damage "upon use". So the whole of
# this cast lands under it, and so does everything else for the rest of the
# window -- about 1.3 times damage on every swing, once every 30 seconds.
#
# Six orbs' worth rather than six orbs: only the final damage an orb pays is
# lifted, not the attack, the boss damage or the DEF one also carries. A Hero
# who never learned a per-orb final damage is paid nothing, which is GMS's
# "while Combo Attack is active" with no gate to write.
#
# The 660ms cast is short for a 5th job skill -- the slashes and the explosions
# play out behind it rather than inside it.
name: "Sword Illusion"
description:
  "Slice forward faster than the eye can see using a combo orb. Sword "
  "Illusion is unaffected by attack reflection."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_HERO_V skill_order: 4 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_ONE_HANDED_SWORD
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_TWO_HANDED_SWORD
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_ONE_HANDED_AXE
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_TWO_HANDED_AXE
base_delay_ms: 660
cooldown_seconds: 30.0
max_enemies: 8
lines: 4
casts: 12
base { skill_pct: 1.30 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.05 }
extra_hit {
  label: "Explosion"
  lines: 5
  casts: 5
  base { skill_pct: 2.60 }
  per_level { skill_pct: 0.10 }
}
buff {
  duration_seconds: 8.0
  raised_on_cast: true
  base { final_dmg_combo_orbs: 6 }
}
